############ 0. web check (2026-09-22) -- see the note for links
althofer.de/collatz-prizes.html: 'Latest Update of this Site: September 21, 2026'; Prize 3 'Updated on August 08, 2026';
  rules: odd n; mover builds 3n+1 or 3n-1, halves to odd; reaching 1 wins; 500 EUR for a proof that all odd starts lead to 1 under optimal play;
  Hartisch: optimal play ends in 1 for n < 1 million; Pochuev manuscript: 'Sept 07, 2026: Checks are still underway'.
github.com/Grisha-Pochuev/3n-plus-minus-1-game (created 2026-08-06, last push 2026-09-01): README 'OPEN', docs/global-proof.md 'OPEN -- HOSTILE AUDIT FAILED'.
Guy, Unsolved Problems in Combinatorial Games (MSRI Publ. 29, 1996), Problem 42: Beans-Don't-Talk, 'are there any O-positions?'

